WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.990 --> 00:00:03.025
code-style's SKILL.md says "See https://kotlinlang.org/docs.": the URL is a link, its period is not

2
00:00:03.025 --> 00:00:05.005
Now "Read www.kotlinlang.org/docs, then commit": the www. URL links to http://www.kotlinlang.org/docs

3
00:00:05.005 --> 00:00:07.013
A URL in code stays code, and one in a link's text is that link's text: one link, to the guide
